#. Translators: A setting: keep the results of every search on this computer.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:949
msgid "Keep a search log"
msgstr "Tenir un journal des recherches"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1603
msgid "Keeps what every search showed, on this computer only, for the last 1,000 searches. Nothing is uploaded."
msgstr "Garde ce que chaque recherche a affiché, sur cet ordinateur seulement, pour les 1 000 dernières recherches. Rien n’est envoyé."

#. Translators: The title of the list of searches Sirensong kept, and the button on Home that opens it.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:372
msgid "Search log"
msgstr "Journal des recherches"

#. Translators: Asked before the search log is emptied.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:383
msgid "Every search kept will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Toutes les recherches gardées seront supprimées. Cette action est irréversible."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:441
msgid "No searches kept yet."
msgstr "Aucune recherche gardée pour l’instant."

#. Translators: In the empty search log, while Keep a search log is off.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:448
msgid "Keep a search log is off, in Settings > Search."
msgstr "« Tenir un journal des recherches » est désactivé, dans Paramètres > Rechercher."

#. Translators: How many results a search in the search log found. {count} is a number.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:471
msgid "Results: {count}"
msgstr "Résultats : {count}"

#. Translators: The button that empties the search log.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:516
msgid "Clear search log"
msgstr "Effacer le journal des recherches"

#. Translators: A setting: a button on Home that opens the search log.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:951
msgid "Search log button on Home"
msgstr "Bouton du journal des recherches dans Accueil"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1612
msgid "A button on Home, beside the map's choices or under the greeting, opens the searches kept."
msgstr "Un bouton dans Accueil, à côté des choix de la carte ou sous le message d’accueil, ouvre les recherches gardées."

#. Translators: A Settings category: the account, playback and the equalizer.
#: src/model.rs:1113
msgid "Listening"
msgstr "Écoute"

#. Translators: A Settings category: the Library, the Home map and Funnel.
#: src/model.rs:1115
msgid "Library & Home"
msgstr "Bibliothèque et Accueil"

#. Translators: A Settings category: themes, the visualizers and the mini player's skins.
#: src/model.rs:1118
msgid "Look & feel"
msgstr "Apparence et style"

#. Translators: A Settings category: Vacuum, and what Sirensong keeps of what you did.
#: src/model.rs:1120
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Confidentialité"

#. Translators: A settings section under Privacy: the play history and the search log Sirensong keeps on this computer.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1780
msgid "Your history"
msgstr "Votre historique"

#. Translators: {file} is the path of the search log file.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1789
msgid "The searches kept while Keep a search log is on, in {file}. This file is never uploaded."
msgstr "Les recherches gardées tant que « Tenir un journal des recherches » est activé, dans {file}. Ce fichier n’est jamais envoyé."
